Red Alert AI Fixes

This is a simple fix for RA1 Remastered AI to allow it to use the full 
unit/structure roster (and possibly fix harvesters). The goal isn't to
make the AI harder, but to give it access to all the game's content.

for a more comprehensive overhaul, with QoL changes, see:
https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2221741447



If you want to edit this, feel free to download the source
as a zip or make a fork. I'm not too picky about credit, so don't
worry about that.

source files should be usable out of the box on Windows 10/11 with 
VS 2017 and its associated MFC and ATL extensions for the v140 Toolset
